  "hashAlgorithm": "blake2b-256",
  "body": {
    "givenName": "ADA Community",
    "motivations": "Cardano represents more than a blockchain; it’s a vision for a decentralized future that empowers individuals to shape their destiny. As a media producer, educator, and L&D professional, I am inspired by the opportunity to blend creativity, education, and human development to make Cardano governance relatable, engaging, and impactful.\n\nWatching the Cardano ecosystem thrive motivates me daily. \n\nBy becoming a DRep, I aim to:\n\nAdvocate for a transparent and inclusive governance system\nSimplify complex governance topics through engaging content and education\nEmpower individuals to actively participate and shape Cardano’s future\nFoster meaningful discussions and innovative solutions within the community\nCardano is our shared ecosystem, and together, we have the unique opportunity to shape its legacy. It’s my privilege to contribute by empowering others and driving sustainable, community-centric growth.",
    "objectives": "I believe in the transformative power of decentralization, where every voice matters and decisions reflect the collective wisdom of the community. I encourage all ADA holders to engage in governance, whether by becoming a DRep themselves or delegating to one who shares their principles and values.\n\nAs a DRep, I commit to transparency, providing clear reasoning for every decision and being open to feedback from my delegators. My goal is to empower others by simplifying governance processes and making participation accessible and meaningful.\n\nMy decisions will always align with:\n\nGreater decentralization and inclusivity\nSustainable ecosystem growth rooted in long-term vision\nResponsible use of treasury funds, ensuring high-impact outcomes\nTransparency and trust, building confidence in governance\nCommunity-driven innovation, promoting creative solutions and collaboration",
    "paymentAddress": "addr1qyvrltd4q63meajj9fks20aclzpswkngjg2v8e8pgnnhy338gpe3aln2nrlex4lxmel3tsggdqvj77hwglx7rkddq3lqgw36tk",
    "qualifications": "ADA Investor ",
